  "effect": "Any registered integer AppOptions key can be overridden for one launch, for example `-EnableTuner 1`. The argument after the dash is hashed (the key name only, not the section); if it names an integer option, the next argument is parsed as the number. String and floating-point options are skipped. The override is not written back to AppOptions.txt.",
